# Clean tables are derived: every pipeline run rebuilds them from data/raw in a single step.
# They were tracked, and a 55 MB parquet that does not delta-compress was being rewritten by
# every nightly commit, adding that much to the repository each night. The raw parts are the
# source of truth; anything that needs the clean tables builds them first.
data/clean/
